item.description:
Now that the Croatian currency has died, they all come to the Gates of Heaven.
First goes the five kuna bill, and Saint Peter says &ldquo;Come in, you&rsquo;re welcome!&rdquo;
Then the ten kuna bill. &ldquo;Come in, you&rsquo;re welcome!&rdquo;
So does the twenty and fifty kuna bills. &ldquo;Come in, you&rsquo;re welcome!&rdquo;
Then comes the hundred kuna bill, expecting to walk in. Saint Peter looks up. &ldquo;Where do you think you&rsquo;re going?&rdquo;
